     A* verify32: display fields with keywords of their own, a *SRC
     A* reference, a date constant, record keywords
     A                                      REF(GLD32R)
     A                                      INDARA
     A          R GLD32A                    CA03(03 'Exit')
     A                                  1  2'Title'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A            NAME      R        B  3  2COLOR(WHT)
     A            OWN           10A  O  4  2TEXT('Own text') DSPATR(HI)
     A            COPY      R        O  5  2REFFLD(OWN *SRC)
     A            AMT       R        B  6  2EDTCDE(J)
     A                                  7  2DATE
     A                                      EDTCDE(Y)
